msgid "[tests/README.md](tests/README.md): how fixtures are generated"
msgstr "[tests/README.md](tests/README.md)：fixture の作り方"

#: ../../../README.md:152
msgid "Documentation"
msgstr "ドキュメント"

#: ../../../README.md:154
msgid ""
"Docs are written in English and built with Sphinx in English and "
"Japanese. The HTML is built by CI and published to GitHub Pages; it is "
"not checked in. The Japanese translation lives in "
"`docs/locale/ja/LC_MESSAGES/*.po`, and the Japanese Markdown generated "
"from it is checked in under [`docs/ja/`](docs/ja/index.md) so it can be "
"read directly on GitHub. `README.ja.md` is built the same way, from "
"`docs/locale/ja/LC_MESSAGES/readme.po` (its code blocks from "
"`docs/locale/ja/readme-code.json`)."
msgstr ""
"ドキュメントは英語で書き、Sphinx で英語と日本語のものをビルドします。HTML は CI がビルドして GitHub Pages "
"に公開するので、リポジトリには入れていません。日本語訳は `docs/locale/ja/LC_MESSAGES/*.po` "
"にあり、そこから作った日本語の Markdown は [`docs/ja/`](docs/ja/index.md) に入れてあるので、GitHub"
" でそのまま読めます。`README.ja.md` "
"も同じ方法で、`docs/locale/ja/LC_MESSAGES/readme.po`（コードブロックは `docs/locale/ja"
"/readme-code.json`）から作ります。"

